@startuml
title TRT Uvicorn Server - UML Deployment Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Operator" as Operator

node "Developer workstation" as Workstation {
  artifact "Project checkout" as Checkout
  artifact ".env\nISAAC_HOST_RUNNER_URL" as DotEnv
  artifact "data/isaac_host_config.json" as HostConfig

  node "Docker Desktop" as Docker {
    node "Container: trt-api" as TrtContainer {
      artifact "Python 3.11 image\nDockerfile.api" as ApiImage
      component "Uvicorn\ntrt_core.api:app\nport 8000" as Uvicorn
      artifact "/app/trt_core" as AppCode
      artifact "/app/scenario_generation" as ScenarioCode
      artifact "/app/schemas" as Schemas
      database "/app/data" as AppData
      database "/app/outputs" as AppOutputs
    }

    node "Container: n8n" as N8nContainer {
      component "n8n\nport 5678" as N8n
      artifact "/home/node/.n8n/imports\nworkflow JSON" as WorkflowImports
    }
  }

  node "Windows host process" as WindowsHost {
    component "Host runner service\nhost_isaac_runner_service.py\nport 8765" as HostRunner
    component "Isaac Sim Python\npython.bat" as IsaacPython
    artifact "UR5 entry script\npick_up_example.py" as PickUp
    database "seed_sweep.sqlite3\nlayout/seed input" as SeedDB
  }

  database "Bind mount: ./data" as HostData
  database "Bind mount: ../dt_exchange\noutputs" as HostOutputs
}

cloud "Remote/local model service" as ModelHost {
  component "vLLM\nOpenAI-compatible\n/v1/chat/completions" as VLLM
}

Operator --> N8n : browser chat/webhooks
Operator --> Uvicorn : direct API calls\noptional
N8n --> Uvicorn : http://trt-api:8000
Uvicorn --> HostRunner : http://host.docker.internal:8765\nhost_runner mode
Uvicorn --> VLLM : chat/dialogue resolution\nwhen configured
HostRunner --> IsaacPython : starts subprocess
IsaacPython --> PickUp : executes script
PickUp --> SeedDB : reads verified layouts
PickUp --> HostOutputs : writes run result SQLite
Uvicorn --> AppData : read/write JSON records
Uvicorn --> AppOutputs : ScenarioSpecs,\nrun artifacts, reports

Checkout --> AppCode : bind mount
Checkout --> ScenarioCode : bind mount
Checkout --> Schemas : bind mount
HostData --> AppData : bind mount
HostOutputs --> AppOutputs : bind mount
DotEnv --> Uvicorn : compose environment
HostConfig --> Uvicorn : host path mapping config
WorkflowImports --> N8n : imported workflows

note right of TrtContainer
  docker-compose.yml publishes:
  - trt-api: localhost:8000
  - n8n: localhost:5678
end note

note right of WindowsHost
  Docker does not execute Windows Isaac paths.
  trt-api sends a host request;
  the host runner expands it into the Isaac command.
end note

@enduml
